<title>USA: Taro gets FDA approval for two drugs.</title>
<headline>Taro gets FDA approval for two drugs.</headline>
<dateline>HAWTHORNE, N.Y. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taro Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd said Thursday it has received marketing approval from the Food and Drug Administration for two drugs, Clomipramine Hydrochloride capsules and Fluocinoide solution.</p>
<p>Clomipramine hydrochloride is an anti-depressant used to treat obsessive-compulsive disorders. Fluocinonide solution is a topical corticosteroid used to treat dermatologic disorders.</p>
<p>The FDA approved abbreviated new drug applications for the two drugs.</p>
</text>
